# Legacy: 早期构建会把图片复制到这里，现在图片由 data-source/CookLikeHOC/images 直接提供。
frontend/public/images/

# --- Upstream reference clone ---
# Full clone of Gar-b-age/CookLikeHOC with its own .git; re-clone it when needed.
# data-source/CookLikeHOC is the trimmed copy actually consumed by the build.
_cooklikehoc/

